1
00:00:02,127 --> 00:00:03,627
(Penny:)Okay, it's done.

2
00:00:03,837 --> 00:00:07,047
(Penny:)Look, guys, for the future,
I don't mind killing the big spiders...

3
00:00:07,257 --> 00:00:10,547
(Penny:)...but you have to at least try
with the little ones.

4
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:14,890
(Sheldon:)Penny, please. We're facing a far more
serious problem than stray arachnids.

5
00:00:15,098 --> 00:00:18,938
- Sheldon, it's not that bad.
- Not bad? It's horrible.

6
00:00:19,102 --> 00:00:22,852
(Sheldon:)You hear stories about this sort of thing.
You never think it will happen to you.

7
00:00:23,064 --> 00:00:26,774
(Leonard:)So they steamed your dumplings.
Get over it.

8
00:00:27,944 --> 00:00:29,824
(Leonard:)New topic, please.

9
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:33,240
(Howard:)All right, Penny.
Let me take this opportunity to point out...

10
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:37,410
(Howard:)...that you are looking particularly
ravishing today.

11
00:00:38,621 --> 00:00:41,411
(Penny:)Not with a thousand condoms, Howard.

12
00:00:43,418 --> 00:00:45,958
(Howard:)So there is a number.

13
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:49,010
(Penny:)Okay. New topic, please.

14
00:00:49,215 --> 00:00:51,555
(Penny:)Hey, did you hear the people
in 5-A are moving out?

15
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:54,140
- No. Shh-shh-shh!
- Why?

16
00:00:54,512 --> 00:00:57,052
- The people upstairs are moving out.
- No.

17
00:00:57,932 --> 00:01:00,222
(Sheldon:)The horror.

18
00:01:00,810 --> 00:01:02,810
(Leonard:)Why would you just say something
like that?

